<h2>What is frozen</h2>
<p>Print and web figures regenerate from the frozen result records in the theme repository. The released accept/defer-gate code consumes canonical utterance records. This companion does not host bulk audio and does not reprint command names.</p>

<h2>What is not redistributed</h2>
<ul>
  <li>LibriSpeech, Aishell, THCHS-30, and MagicData audio are not shipped on these Pages. Use the official corpus sources.</li>
  <li>ESC-50 is data-only (CC BY-NC family). No CC-BY-NC code is executed to build this site.</li>
  <li>MagicData remains evaluation data under CC BY-NC-ND; the archive stores derived per-utterance CER metrics, not audio or transcripts.</li>
  <li>The submitted manuscript PDF is not hosted here.</li>
</ul>
